&_nc_oc=AdrzDeX9UiW_yapJftD93m9gN9O90YIyk4Glm2cRkc_nBwC2epIz5T4FpllgOYIYm50&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIz05eL9uawAj9chdRmQVii_0eTtcVmhgPRpaTaFewhGQ&oe=6AA56CBE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fzxzWD5yO8YQ7kNvwE8L98d&_nc_oc=AdqYfbL_kLFCuEdRBsNgH80eWbRCaYJbZvJ39ktUzKXK7MYlgmpFbXaCwOvnMv10mFA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKQzxlZ9GpbCMNMxvqQznbe2F-ki4KLX3caEwktiZEfaA&oe=6AA5457C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BiGDv_V8cC8Q7kNvwFIK-F-&_nc_oc=AdpZEPFEAFu7mg3dYHk1CLYahcP4InKEvntBEhJQsM1WdCYbIq4tf7kWZdPWOL_ldZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL-lCqmD-q0wcfLQK_IgqesSMWl_CDg_J13tpyFA_h7nA&oe=6AA56407"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e8XtzmdVdd8Q7kNvwEYcIZd&_nc_oc=Adoh6S8pE9sZ9062b0RP8S8iD4wuxXIYYiW01KspPChWBu6OreoVWrsaXZYlhWZkeJo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI-pDB8Hs6cX_2OBq9yswnEf6-w4YF8MyAEbH7eiK7FHg&oe=6AA54FD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ITfj0E8J3_kQ7kNvwEQzaOT&_nc_oc=AdpXVKfvKqC2FpWExK01OZXMKqUtKYwOsTbZ5ikVu8Df4FCprNUFlkymxyR4mZXSdLc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLIPRF0snFq9-Rc7dlwWFN7oUv6gMiLaePFJzi5LSqDhg&oe=6AA55C64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.